    <p>layer. The model is trained using a cross-entropy loss:</p>

    <div class="eq-block">
      $$\mathcal{L}_{cls} = -\sum_{k \in \{pos, rot, open\}} \sum_{b=1}^{B_k} y_{k,b} \log(\hat{y}_{k,b})$$
      <span class="eq-num">(7)</span>
